                                                "sense_id": "774a6bb0-835f-3afd-8830-ad1a7fbccd03",
                                                "text": "In 2012 in Florida, a staggering 88% of all license suspensions were due to failure to comply with summons or fines, which is insane. It also leaves only 12% for Florida’s other most common violations: accidentally taking your golf cart on the freeway, feeding meth to an alligator, feeding an alligator to a meth dealer, and being an alligator meth dealer. Florida!"
                                            },
